account\">Sign in</a></nav></header>' +\n      /* Owner direction: no top subheading bar. #sh-freshness stays as a plain empty\n         div (invisible while empty) so the rare same-session refresh notice still has\n         somewhere to render if a newer story arrives after the first paint. */\n      '<main id=\"sh-main\"><div id=\"sh-freshness\"></div>' + gameday() +\n      '<section class=\"sh-front\" aria-label=\"Front page stories\"><div class=\"sh-feature\"><article class=\"sh-lead' + (lead.portrait ? ' sh-lead-portrait' : '') + '\"><figure>' + link(lead, photo(lead,true)) + credit + '</figure><div class=\"sh-lead-copy\"><p class=\"sh-kicker\">' + (lead === breaking ? 'Breaking' : /buddy martin/i.test(lead.author) ? 'The Buddy Martin column' : /franz beard/i.test(lead.author) ? 'Franz Beard' : 'Top Story') + '</p>' + link(lead,'<h1>' + esc(lead.title) + '</h1>') + '<p class=\"sh-deck\">' + esc(lead.excerpt) + '</p>' + meta(lead) + link(lead, 'Read the story <span aria-hidden=\"true\">→</span>', 'sh-read') + '</div></article><div class=\"sh-support\">' + supporting.map(support).join('') + '</div></div>' +\n      '<aside class=\"sh-latest\"><h2 class=\"sh-section-title\">Latest</h2><div class=\"sh-latest-grid\">' + latest.map(item).join('') + '</div><a class=\"sh-more\" href=\"/gatorbait-media-blogs\">All stories →</a></aside></section>' +\n      (cols ? '<section class=\"sh-voices\" aria-label=\"GatorBait columnists\"><div class=\"sh-voices-label\"><p class=\"sh-kicker\">Only at GatorBait</p><h2>The voices <br>you come for.</h2></div>' + cols + '</section>' : '') +\n      '<section class=\"sh-lower\"><div>' + (more.length ? '<h2 class=\"sh-section-title\">More from the newsroom</h2><div class=\"sh-coverage\">' + more.map(support).join('') + '</div>' : '') + '</div><aside><div class=\"sh-watch sh-reference\"><p class=\"sh-kicker\">Up next</p><h2>Florida at Missouri</h2><p>Saturday, Oct. 3 · 3:30 p.m. ET. The Gators are 4-0 after beating No. 4 Ole Miss 52-28.</p>